---
import JasiLabLayout from "../../layouts/JasiLabLayout.astro";
---

<JasiLabLayout
  title="Request Tambla UG data deletion - JasiLab"
  description="Request deletion of some or all personal data in Tambla UG without closing your account."
>
  <section class="section-band max-w-3xl">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-wide text-primary-deep">
      <a href="/tambla/" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">Tambla UG</a>
    </p>
    <h1 class="display-lg mt-2">Request data deletion (keep account)</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-body leading-relaxed">
      Tambla UG is a product of
      <strong class="text-ink-strong">Connected Verification Digital Uganda Limited</strong> (trading as
      <strong class="text-ink-strong">CVT</strong>). You can request deletion of some or all of your personal data
      <strong class="text-ink-strong">without deleting your Tambla account</strong>, where the law and our retention
      obligations allow.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-body leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">How to request data deletion</h2>
      <ol class="list-decimal space-y-3 pl-5">
        <li>
          Email
          <a
            href="mailto:privacy@cvt.ug?subject=Tambla%20UG%20data%20deletion%20request"
            class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">privacy@cvt.ug</a
          >
          from a reachable address.
        </li>
        <li>
          Use subject line: <strong class="text-ink-strong">Tambla UG data deletion request</strong>
        </li>
        <li>
          Include:
          <ul class="mt-2 list-disc space-y-1 pl-5">
            <li>Your Tambla / WhatsApp phone number (with country code, e.g. +256…)</li>
            <li>Your full name as registered</li>
            <li>Optional: plate number or CVT verification ID</li>
            <li>
              What you want deleted (for example: profile photo, specific documents, push tokens, location history, or
              “all deletable data while keeping my account”)
            </li>
            <li>A clear statement that you want to <strong class="text-ink-strong">keep your Tambla account</strong></li>
          </ul>
        </li>
        <li>We will verify it is you before acting on the request.</li>
      </ol>

      <p>
        <a
          class="inline-flex items-center rounded-lg bg-primary-deep px-4 py-2 font-medium text-white hover:bg-primary"
          href="mailto:privacy@cvt.ug?subject=Tambla%20UG%20data%20deletion%20request&body=I%20request%20deletion%20of%20some%2Fall%20of%20my%20Tambla%20UG%20data%20while%20keeping%20my%20account.%0A%0APhone%20(E.164)%3A%20%0AFull%20name%3A%20%0APlate%20(optional)%3A%20%0ACVT%20ID%20(optional)%3A%20%0AData%20to%20delete%3A%20%0A"
        >
          Email data deletion request
        </a>
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">What we can delete or may keep</h2>
      <p>Where permitted, we can delete or anonymise data such as:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>Optional profile content (for example a profile photo you uploaded)</li>
        <li>Device push tokens</li>
        <li>Location / hail matching data that is no longer required for an active service need</li>
        <li>Other Tambla app data that is not required to keep your membership/account working</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We may retain data needed for verification accountability, fraud prevention, disputes, security, legal
        obligations, or to keep your account usable (for example phone number used for WhatsApp OTP sign-in, core
        identity / verification records under CVT’s retention schedule). If something cannot be deleted while your
        account stays open, we will explain that in our reply.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">How long it takes</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to complete verified requests within <strong class="text-ink-strong">30 days</strong>. Complex cases may
        take longer; we will tell you if so.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">Want to close the whole account instead?</h2>
      <p>
        Use
        <a href="/tambla/delete-account" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary"
          >jasilab.net/tambla/delete-account</a
        >.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-ink-strong">Related links</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc space-y-2 pl-5">
        <li>
          <a href="/tambla/privacy" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary">Tambla UG Privacy Policy</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://www.cvt.co.ug/en/support/privacy" class="text-primary-deep hover:text-primary"
            >CVT platform Privacy Policy</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</JasiLabLayout>
